		(descr "TI DPW0005A X2SON-5 0.8 x 0.8 x 0.4 mm (TLV7031DPWR). Corrected copy of OpenDrone:X2SON-4_L0.8-W0.8-P0.48-TL-A per TI 4223102/D p67 (solder mask defined): TI pin numbers 1 top-left, 2 bottom-left, 3 = CENTRE square, 4 bottom-right, 5 top-right (the OpenDrone footprint numbers the centre 5 and the right pads 3/4, which miswires the TI-numbered TLV7031DPWR symbol); copper = exposed + 0.05, mask and paste = exposed. DENSE: exposed outer edge 0.60 -> 0.45 (0.05 past the body) for the X2SON area budget.")
