	(gr_text "ROUTING CHEAT SHEET  -  8L HDI 1+6+1  -  NextPCB  -  keys from user.hotkeys (Cmd+V = paste)\nLAYERS   L1 parts | L2 GND | L3 sig | L4 PWR | L5 PWR | L6 sig | L7 GND | L8 parts\n\nVIA          SIZE                     SPAN         KEY (Mac)\nmicro        0.25/0.10                L1-L2 L8-L7  V (while routing)\nburied       0.33/0.15  (all classes) L2-L7        Shift+V\nthrough      none - DRC error\npick layer   Opt+V (blind; \"via pass\" converts it)\nlabel check  1-2 / 7-8 micro | 2-7 buried | 1-8 through\n\nESCAPE (stacked allowed, order = HDI Rank 2)\nGND pin      pad > V > L2                 done\nsignal       pad > V > Shift+V same spot > L3/L6\npower        stacked micro+buried array > L4/L5\nfine pitch   micro in pad (filled + capped)\noptional     stagger buried 0.25 c-c (lands overlap)\n\nNEVER\nmicro on micro   micro L1-L3   via on RF net   tracks on L2/L7   2 oz copper\n\nWIDTHS\nmin track 0.089 (3.5 mil)   RF 50R 0.105 gap 0.15   USB 90R 0.12/0.12\n\nCHECK\nE on via = type + layers   DRC per block   B = refill zones\n\"holes co-located\" warning on a stack = expected"
		(at 56 139 0)
		(layer "Cmts.User")
		(uuid "520a7be7-a428-4a92-81b5-3ac2d1399148")
		(effects
			(font
				(size 0.8 0.8)
				(thickness 0.12)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
	)
	(gr_text "STACKUP 8L HDI 1+6+1, 1.0 mm (0.997), 1 oz all layers, ENIG\nL1 F.Cu     parts, RF, power loops\n  1080 0.077\nL2 In1.Cu   GND plane, no tracks\n  1080 0.077\nL3 In2.Cu   signals\n  core 0.127\nL4 In3.Cu   +BATT plane\n  2116 0.125\nL5 In4.Cu   +5V_BST/+5V/+3V3 plane\n  core 0.127\nL6 In5.Cu   signals, ESC gate and BEMF\n  1080 0.077\nL7 In6.Cu   GND plane, no tracks\n  1080 0.077\nL8 B.Cu     parts, RF, power loops"
